{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01243","headline":"相和歌辞 饮马长城窟行 · 太宗皇帝","name":"相和歌辞 饮马长城窟行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塞外悲风切，交河冰已结。\n瀚海百重波，阴山千里雪。\n迥戍危烽火，层峦引高节。\n悠悠卷斾旌，饮马出长城。\n寒沙连骑迹，朔吹断边声。\n胡尘清玉塞，羌笛韵金钲。\n绝寞干戈戢，车徒振原隰。\n都尉反龙堆，将军旋马邑。\n扬麾氛雾静，纪石功名立。\n荒裔一戎衣，云台凯歌入。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01243.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01243","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}